    {
      "id": "fm-radio",
      "title": {
        "en": "My tabletop radio",
        "zh": "我的桌面收音机"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Receive a broadcast and adjust its volume.",
        "zh": "接收广播，调一调声音的大小。"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "en": "FM receives a broadcast. C4 carries the audio signal to RV; U4 amplifies it for SP. The two battery holders are connected exactly as shown.",
        "zh": "FM 接收广播，C4 将声音信号传给 RV，U4 放大信号，让 SP 发声。两个电池盒必须按图中的方式连接。"
      },
      "test_instruction": {
        "en": "With an adult, check every layer and battery direction. Turn the volume down. Turn S1 on, press R once, then T to find a station. Adjust RV gently and switch off after listening.",
        "zh": "和大人核对每一层和电池方向，先调低音量。打开 S1，按一次 R，再按 T 找电台，轻轻调整 RV。听完关闭开关。"
      },
      "troubleshooting": [
        {
          "en": "Switch off before checking FM + / OUT / − and the two battery holders. Never add another power source.",
          "zh": "检查前先关开关。核对 FM 的 +、OUT、− 和两个电池盒，不添加其他电源。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Reception also depends on your location and available stations; a correct diagram cannot guarantee reception.",
          "zh": "能否收到广播也取决于所在位置和当地电台；搭建图正确不等于一定能收到信号。"
        }
      ],
